{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/f35bynrvjl4fxe9uh5uz0djy43xcmzv.mp3","text":"唔......博士，你是不是有点缺乏运动啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/a5dmjxwdrhge42ecdh49uejeil2f196.mp3","text":"罗德岛的大家都非常和善，即使我想做恶作剧都有点不忍心下手呢......啊，吃饭的时间到了，我去帮忙！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/rsazwzztcothztvthgws3vvxu66cfpg.mp3","text":"登山可不只是我的兴趣而已，而是事业哦！事！业！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/cl3f2tlysmp3rpzno885ydvoq3cgj8i.mp3","text":"腿上的环？啊，你是问这个环是怎么回事吗？这只是个装饰品啦~因为这里有块结晶嘛。想摸摸看吗~？","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/9dsxnwkvtwggpz2peuxrf2ikwxy7stn.mp3","text":"角峰叔其实是老哥派来保护我的吧......这个老哥真是不坦率，啊啊，想想就来气！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/42wk8twzq9b57t7izksmjfimv91q96j.mp3","text":"我从小就想爬上喀兰圣山看看——自从姐姐成为圣女离我们而去之后，这想法就越来越强烈......博士，多多的锻炼我吧，总有一天我要爬上它的顶峰，把姐姐接回家。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/8sbpu9yfn3obusrcyow16gy3moo2319.mp3","text":"在登山领域，我可是不会输给任何人的！毕竟没有人比我更熟悉手上的工具了，就连作为武器，都是它们更顺手呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/sly0otaplyj05obun429pshhworbak8.mp3","text":"是啊，矿石病彻底改变了我。但就此消沉下去的话，我才真的不是我了吧？无论未来怎么样，自己决定的事情，就该自己去努力完成嘛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/s49txf35j8q2on9dzlxmday0ey2ghgh.mp3","text":"下雪了呢。......希瓦艾什一家永远回不到过去，我明白的。一切都和过去不一样了。除了雪......和故乡一样的，一片片的雪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/imenxpwgi90e9xe7difbkqrfwl563dc.mp3","text":"博——士！博——士啊啊！真是的，既然睡着了就没办法了！Bye-bye！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/1sx2jm9deanrhhqq0ow7ojnbuarv1y1.mp3","text":"我就是将要触摸天际的崖心，请多关照！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/l631umosyoim2fbcbxwp0zkb9x3foky.mp3","text":"嗯——很新奇的体验呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/0ntyykg4dg85efsyzox2ekku2bbdtbv.mp3","text":"晋升？好哇！我们吃个蛋糕庆祝下吧！好吧？看，从后勤组那儿顺手拿来的，不要紧的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/jzvyvhmuk8xv2i0yj33qfd9i5e221z8.mp3","text":"嘿，博士挺有眼光的嘛。确实，我可是超强的，你要好好运用我的力量哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/e6ybr9fkvm6eaaaelzo6t67c0q9via1.mp3","text":"好，干劲涌上来了！一口气登上最高峰吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/th0yyl31axknrvwefd835td0dv58cod.mp3","text":"唉？？突然就让我领导大家什么的，这......","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/9cu6cqeiju4010n0twj8gntl73jiine.mp3","text":"接下来可不能粗心大意了，要认真对待。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/16iv480ii5hwmnh8tqqj2v3nlbf211k.mp3","text":"我可不会手下留情！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/6rzyxg8q96h99v2cldemigggbjjpn1u.mp3","text":"在呢！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/b0edj6k2brq607gua9berwwik7q21qy.mp3","text":"这里吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/6ctfcpqpuh0fs3qj1iyje2m4b4tln0d.mp3","text":"交给我吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/27/qgz8efv6ysdoc93cbbarfm56dbw9pi4.mp3","text":"完全没问题！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/2i68p07adxju0pt3rdlqt9gsgv1ytxo.mp3","text":"逮·住·你·了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/lax95usmaohlugiiixf6aflfh768u4t.mp3","text":"一钩一个，轻轻松松~","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/bq29zfo5c0lhpcxl546iuqeufez97m1.mp3","text":"门外汉只会摔下万丈深渊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/qkyqdan6b7crn3y3cv7uzkfsan8rwwc.mp3","text":"以希瓦艾什之名起誓——！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/a4x9hxib9dzwa44iy3dh4h39qf5mus7.mp3","text":"世上没有无法攀登的山峰，也没有无法跨越的绝境！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/h9yas9u2etu32qhd59j3o67w2se0qkw.mp3","text":"有我在，这不是理所当然的嘛！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/5f64pi5ez1kgeyjb5myeg6p2x55ux2x.mp3","text":"啊，逃的可真快！","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/6ie6hbv38siscjmojy8tph3b22dn0rp.mp3","text":"唔......我是不是出丑了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/nfoqrr3jaap4tdwj4m338273fj6ef3c.mp3","text":"真暖和呢，我就在这窝会儿好了~","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/frvjv7nkbk14gdy7xy0v7aj01ucgphh.mp3","text":"等等！别......","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/e2x3h2g73q53nc417bwp2drnxs26izn.mp3","text":"博士，下次让我教你登山吧，你一定会喜欢的~","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/df8qv74l7jypg4rvo4l3a5787j0r4dm.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/7gqhhnf18lwoyvp6vg2nq2e8yx3d6vd.mp3","text":"新年快乐！看，给博士用的登山器材我都准备好了，快走吧！嗯？外面还是半夜？当然啦，我们要早点爬上山顶去迎接新年的日出啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/gy0rclvaszyd8346i8wxklw74irvmui.mp3","text":"早安哦，博士~","alt":"voice_cn/char_173_slchan/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/b29a3v1ktsljftxena28gd65mhzhy2w.mp3","text":"唔......博士，你是不是有点缺乏运动啊。","alt":"voice/char_173_slchan/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/tmjua4dbsuj6sodqofgz3y4oc4mt276.mp3","text":"罗德岛的大家都非常和善，即使我想做恶作剧都有点不忍心下手呢......啊，吃饭的时间到了，我去帮忙！","alt":"voice/char_173_slchan/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/2oeqd56brwi9v4uadmolvk9g40q3b79.mp3","text":"登山可不只是我的兴趣而已，而是事业哦！事！业！","alt":"voice/char_173_slchan/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/ficcj9btd81ljwrwrhuiajfoppydq7y.mp3","text":"腿上的环？啊，你是问这个环是怎么回事吗？这只是个装饰品啦~因为这里有块结晶嘛。想摸摸看吗~？","alt":"voice/char_173_slchan/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/nohi652otfwm4p9hpopg41umezq6eay.mp3","text":"角峰叔其实是老哥派来保护我的吧......这个老哥真是不坦率，啊啊，想想就来气！","alt":"voice/char_173_slchan/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/jz8uhfyhaaff2k1pdxpiganp596xbd0.mp3","text":"我从小就想爬上喀兰圣山看看——自从姐姐成为圣女离我们而去之后，这想法就越来越强烈......博士，多多的锻炼我吧，总有一天我要爬上它的顶峰，把姐姐接回家。","alt":"voice/char_1